SIMPLE  =                    T / Fits standard                                  BITPIX  =                   16 / Bits per pixel                                 NAXIS   =                    0 / Number of axes                                 EXTEND  =                    T / There maybe standard extensions                ORIGIN  = 'NOAO-IRAF Fits Kernel 1Mar97' / FITS file originator                 IRAF-TLM= '08:41:32 (23/07/1997)' / Time of last modification                   FILENAME= 'l7a15023o_pht.fits'                                                  TELESCOP= 'HST     '           /                                                INSTRUME= 'STIS    '           /                                                DETECTOR= 'CCD     '           /                                                DATE    = '2001-07-10T19:52:49'/                                                FILETYPE= 'PHOTOMETRIC CONVERSION TABLE' /                                      OBSTYPE = 'IMAGING '           /                                                USEAFTER= 'OCT 01 1996 00:00:00'                                                PEDIGREE= 'GROUND  '           /                                                DESCRIP = 'Ground Cal/Component efficiencies' /                                 APERTURE= 'ANY     '           /                                                CENWAVE =                 -999 /                                                HISTORY   Photometric throughput files delivered by the IDT on 7/22/97.         HISTORY   They include both the STIS component efficiencies and the OTA         HISTORY   efficiency.                                                           HISTORY = 'ccd_imaging_pht.fits renamed to h7o0858mo_pht.fits on Jul 24 1997'   HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   History for CCD imaging throughput update (June 2001)                 HISTORY   Analysis of 50CCD and F28X50LP CCD images of stars of                 HISTORY   a variety of colors with well deterimined spectral                    HISTORY   energy distributions, indicate that  the red end                      HISTORY   sensitivity of CCD imaging is substantially lower                     HISTORY   than initial estimates.                                               HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   Data used was primarily from programs 8422 and  8842.                 HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   Adopted on orbit throughput measurements for F28X50LP                 HISTORY   and then adjusted CCD throughput curve until                          HISTORY   differences between observed imaging fluxes and                       HISTORY   synphot calculations based on the best estimate of                    HISTORY   each star's spectrum were minimized. Full description                 HISTORY   of analysis is given in a forthcoming ISR.                            NEXTEND =                    1                                                  COMMENT = 'Charles R. Proffitt, June 5, 2001'                                   HISTORY   revised_pht.fits renamed to l7a15023o_pht.fits on Jul 10 2001         END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             XTENSION= 'BINTABLE'           /Written by IDL:  22-Jul-1997 09:24:13.00        BITPIX  =                    8 /                                                NAXIS   =                    2 /Binary table                                    